mintcare (1.7.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * Self-update: checks GitHub for new releases, verifies the SHA-256
    checksum and installs the package.
  * Firmware updates through fwupd/LVFS on the Hardware page.
  * Software sources health: never-downloaded, wrong-series, duplicate and
    broken-key sources; disable/enable third-party sources; apt test run.
  * Security page: listening services, exposure, firewall state, identify
    programs (admin) and turn off risky services.
  * Health trend chart on the dashboard.

